ConditionMet_Escrow_Unit_Concrete_Test
├── when the condition is amount reached
│   ├── when the escrow holds at least the amount
│   │   └── it should return true
│   └── when it holds less
│       └── it should return false
└── when the condition is owner collects
    ├── when the bootstrap owner term is zero
    │   └── it should return true, even for an owner with no code
    ├── when the owner has no code
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when isOwner of the bootstrap owner reverts
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when isOwner returns fewer or more than 32 bytes
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when isOwner returns a word that is neither 0 nor 1
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when the bootstrap owner is the owner's only owner
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when the bootstrap owner is one of several owners
    │   └── it should return false
    ├── when the owner has one owner who is not the bootstrap owner
    │   └── it should return true
    ├── when the owner has two owners and neither is the bootstrap owner
    │   └── it should return true
    └── when the bootstrap owner term names someone other than the factory's Companies House
        └── it should check only its own term
